/*
 * Tree files support: store the exported block device as a tree of
 * small block files underneath a directory named after the export.
 *
 * The export is split into TREEPAGESIZE-byte blocks. Each directory
 * holds at most TREEDIRSIZE entries (files or subdirectories), so the
 * blocks are addressed by the digits of their block number written in
 * base TREEDIRSIZE, most significant digit first. Intermediate
 * directories are named TREEXXXX, leaf block files FILEXXXX, with XXXX
 * the zero-padded digit value.
 *
 * See nbd-server(5) for details.
